<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</title>
<headline>Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat weekly estimate, to January 29 of 1995/96 shipments (1996/97 wheat), 1995/96 export commitments (1996/97 wheat) and purchases by exporters in indicated crop years (thousands of tonnes).</p>
<p> ...........shipments..commits..crop year...exporter purchases</p>
<p> .............................................1995/96..1996/97</p>
<p> Bread wheat  4,321.0  7,800.0   Dec-Nov	4,762.2  6,460.7</p>
<p> Maize	  6,950.9  2,600.0   Mar-Feb	6,748.7  1,312.9</p>
<p> Sorghum	  665.7    670.0   Mar-Feb	  634.5     28.7</p>
<p> Soybeans     2,011.8  2,100.0   Apr-Mar	2,062.8    837.6</p>
<p> Sunseeds	 537.3    600.0   Jan-Dec	  583.6     17.7</p>
